{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>An abomination</b> — for one who goes to do evil." "<b>And pursues</b> — a participle going out for itself or for another. And the meaning: that one is commanded to pursue righteousness — HaShem will love him, corresponding to 'an abomination of YHWH.'"], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:56.749293374Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}